window.products.push({"id":139007,"name":"WP37001287 Dryer Idler Pulley Maytag Assembly AP6008789 PS11741930 1164466 5-0269 500269P WP37001287VP Ultra Durable Replacement MDET336AYW ADE7005AYW","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QB7nX4ljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Idler Assembly Wp37001287 - A high-quality exact equivalent for part numbers AP6008789, 37001287, 5-0269, 500269, 500269P, PS11741930, WP37001287VP. Comes assembled for easier installation. Wp37001287 Dryer Idler Pulley Replacement is compatible with Maytag, Admiral, Amana, Crosley, Magic Chef, Speed Queen. Maytag Wp37001287 is responsible for providing tension to the dryer belt, and the spring helps to keep the pulley in place. It fits hundreds of models and can be installed in minutes. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the part? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Maytag Dryer Idler Assembly Wp37001287 will help if your appliance is noisy, doesn't tumble, or doesn't start. The installation of the Wp37001287 Idler Pulley is relatively easy and can be done with basic tools. It is important to ensure that the dryer is unplugged before starting any repairs. 💡 Maytag Dryer Wp37001287 Assembly is a part used in many different models of clothes dryers. This part is designed to provide tension to the dryer belt, which is responsible for turning the drum of the dryer. Without the proper tension, the dryer belt can slip or become loose, which can cause the drum to stop turning or make loud noises. Wp37001287 Dryer Idler Pulley Assembly meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 How long is the life span of an idler pulley? The lifespan of a Dryer Idler Pulley Wp37001287 can vary depending on factors such as usage, maintenance, and the quality of the part itself. Generally, the Idler Pulley can last anywhere from 5 to 10 years or more with proper care and maintenance. If you notice any signs of wear or damage to your dryer idler pulley, it is important to replace the part with a new Maytag Part Wp37001287, as soon as possible to avoid further damage to your dryer. 💡 What happens if you don't fix an idler pulley? A faulty or damaged idler pulley in a dryer can cause belt slippage, overheating, damage to other parts, and excessive noise. If left unaddressed, these issues can lead to further damage to the dryer and potential safety hazards such as fire. It is important to address any issues with the idler pulley as soon as possible to avoid costly repairs and potential safety risks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QB7nX4ljL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B088TV3TH3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TV3TH3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TV3TH3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
