window.products.push({"id":139106,"name":"Upgraded 285785 Washer Clutch Assembly & 285753A Motor Coupling Kit by Knob for Whirlpool Kenmore Washers. Replaces 285331 285422 285540 285785VP 3350","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616PcPnjUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"285785 washer clutch assembly is found in your washing machine and is responsible for spinning the basket during the spin cycle. This assembly includes a brake cam driver, blue springs for large capacity washers, a black spring for compact washers, and the installation instructions. 285753A motor coupling, also known as a coupling kit, is a newer version of the part and is used in your washer. The piece includes new metal sleeves that have been added in order to strengthen the part. This part works between the transmission and the motor; it is only used on direct drive washers with no belt. In order to replace this part, you will need a flat blade screw driver, a quarter inch nut driver, and a Phillips screw driver. Before making this repair remember to disconnect the power supply, and both fill hoses. Works with brands: Whirlpool, Kenmore other brands. Replace part number: ◆ 285785 Washer Clutch Kit: 2670, 285331, 285380, 285422, 285540, 285761, 285785, 285785VP, 3350015, 3350114, 3350115, 3351342, 3351343, 387888, 388948, 388949, 3946794, 3946847, 3951311, 3951312, 62699, 63174, 63765, 64176, AP3094537. ◆ 285753A motor coupling: 1195967, 21003, 280152, 285140, 285743, 285753, 285753A, 285753AVP, 3352470, 3363664, 3364002, 3364003, 62672, 62693, 661560, 80008, 8559748, AP3963893, ER285753, SB285753A. Fixes the following symptoms: If you have any of the following symptoms, replacing your appliance could solve the problem ◆ Pumps but will not spin ◆ Spins slowly ◆ Will not agitate ◆ Noisy Please reach out to us if you have a question about compatibility. Comment below in the customer questions and answer section or send us a message on the us storefront. We’re happy to help ensure you select the right part number for your washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616PcPnjUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knob","source_asin":"B08K3MHFHX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K3MHFHX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K3MHFHX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
