window.products.push({"id":139145,"name":"(3-pack) Whirlpool, Maytag, or Kitchen Aid Compatible Fresh Flow Filters Bundle Pack - Replaces W10346771a and W10311524","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812O9qL0SzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To Replace Your Produce Preserver: 1) Find the Produce Preserver housing inside the refrigerator. 2) Open the housing by pulling up and out on the back. 3)Remove the Produce Preserver pouches from the packaging and place them into the housing. To Replace Your Air Filter: 1) Locate the filter cover at the top of the interior wall of the refrigerator2) Lift open the vented door3) Remove old filter by squeezing tabs together and pull out4) Insert new filter About the Produce Preserver Fruits and vegetables produce a naturally occurring chemical called Ethylene. Ethylene induces natural ripening in fruits and vegetables. In fact, a number of fruits and vegetables emit small amounts of ethylene gas during their ripening process which leads to an increased level of ethylene gas in the air. This in turn threatens the life cycle of post-harvest fruits and vegetables. Our preservers work by absorbing the ethylene gas that produce naturally gives off lengthening the life of produce About the Air Filter The air filter is installed in front of an air vent which actively pushes air through the filter. Our premium air filter works nonstop to filter the air in your refrigerator eliminating odors naturally and keeping the refrigerator smelling fresh. Our filter is proven to be fifteen times more effective then baking soda. Additional Information: In this bundle, you will receive enough preservers for 3 use, along with 3 air filters. Each pack can last up to 6 months. Please note that the indicator strips are not included in this sale You Should Know We are not affiliated with , nor are these products made by Whirlpool .. The Whirlpool , KitchenAid and FreshFlow brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their owners. Any use of any aforementioned brand names are made solely for purposes of illustrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812O9qL0SzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artist Unknown","source_asin":"B01K8XGLYM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139145","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01K8XGLYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01K8XGLYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
