window.products.push({"id":139214,"name":"Universal Replacement French Press Filter: 4 Inch Stainless Steel Mesh Replacements for Bodum or Compatible Coffee Press Filters - French Press Screen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdONmZNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get The Best Tasting Coffee Straight From Your French Press Coffee Maker - Richer taste - Your new Slimm Premium French Press Coffee Filter returns your coffee maker to like new condition. The result is a much richer, fuller tasting coffee. Coffee enthusiasts recommend replacing your filter to ensure the best cup. Rid yourself of rust, clogged grinds and even mold that can impact your coffee. - No fuss - You can change your French Press Coffee Filter in just seconds. - No grit in your cup - Your Slimm 4\" Premium Coffee Filter uses a super fine mesh that fits most 8 cup French Press Coffee Makers such as Bodum, Grosche, Sterling, Bonjour and other compatible makers. Manufactured to exacting standards to ensure long-term durability and a sturdy mesh design with super fine filtration. Includes a reinforced metal center piece to improve stability and durability of your replacement filter. - So easy to clean - Rinse your Slimm Premium French Press Coffee Filter under the tap for a few seconds. The grinds simply wash off it just like that. Clean up is exactly the same as your current French Press coffee maker. Manufactured To The Highest Standards to Return Your French Press Coffee Maker to New - Made specifically your French Press Coffee Maker. - Only high-grade materials are used and are made to exact standards to meet or exceed your current filter. - Dishwasher safe. ** LIMITED TIME BONUS ** - Now for a limited time, get not one but TWO Slimm Premium French Press Coffee Filters in the pack. Use one now, and save the other to replace in the future without the need to purchase another filter! - Bonus book download - The Perfect Brew - How to Make the Most of Your French Press Coffee Maker Click the Button on the top and enjoy the perfect cup of coffee today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FdONmZNBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Slimm Filter","source_asin":"B01COB9EBS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139214","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01COB9EBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01COB9EBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
