window.products.push({"id":139218,"name":"Deli-kit® 27.5 inch Gas Cooktop Dual Fuel Sealed 5 Burners Tempered Glass Gas Cooktop Drop-in Gas Hob DK156-A01 Gas Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UXFWlcpEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"We take the advanced tempered glass with anti-explosion cloth on the background ,it can prevent the explode when abnormal condition(Such as unequel pressure,flame is not normal etc). Product Features Direction 1,Our product size and cut hole size will be show in the insert pictures. There are four type of burners: 3.3KW triple ring work burner,2.75kw Rapid Burner,1 or 2 1.75kw Semi Rapid burner,1 kw Auxiliary Burner; Which make all kinds of heating power output.The cast iron support are heavy and stable, coated with enamel , make it high temperature resistance and not easy to rust. the four feet under the cooker make it can use as table-top style also, easy to cook all kinds of food as you like. 2,This products is suitable for Nature Gas source but there are convert nozzle and BS brass joint for LPG source in the package.There is adjustment valve for flame adjustment. When you think the minimum flame is not enough,it can adjust in the place of knob and We rather professional to do so .If you want to change the gas source, please invite professional. Function attention 1,Our product take 110 Voltage AC power ignition but if outside without AC power, it can ignition with lighter or other flame. 2,The figure of product will confirm by main product picture. 3, Our product have 100% inspection on whole products, gas leakage inspection and valves inspection and enjoy our products safely. 4,After installation of our product, please check all the joints and make sure they are sealed well.Put the burner set, burner caps and woks are in the right position. 5,You can click the blue Delikit after the Sold by will find more products in our shop. 6,If you have any other requirement on products or service please leave your message in our Customer Questions& answers in the website。","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UXFWlcpEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deli-Kit","source_asin":"B07FFXYJL1","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FFXYJL1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FFXYJL1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":139219,"name":"Della Stainless Steel Ice Maker 35lb Per Day Portable Countertop Freestanding Icemaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QtSwOVcfL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"You can make ice cubes for parties or hot summer days within a few minutes with the Portable Ice Maker. Its compact and contemporary design makes it easy to transport and stylish to display. This countertop ice machine features the compressor cooling system and operates at low noise. The modern design and adjustable cube size add to the unique functionality of this Countertop Ice. Features: Compact & Portable- Perfect for your RV, boat, or small kitchen, this ice maker is compact, bars, restaurants, portable and works anywhere there is an outlet available Beautiful Finish & attractive stainless steel finish ice maker Ice Production- Able to make up to 35 lbs. in 24 hours of bullet ice cubes per day, you'll never have to deal with pesky ice trays ever again Insulated Storage Bin- The integrated storage bin is well-insulated and is able to hold lbs. of ice at a time Have Ice Fast- You can create ready-to-serve ice in an average of 6 minutes Easy-to-Use Controls turn this ice maker on/off and choose your ice size (small, medium and large) using this units easy-to-use control panel When the water level in the reservoir runs low, yours be alerted to add more water. When the ice bucket is full, yours be alerted to remove them so more ice could be created Specifications: Colors: Stainless Steel Voltage: 115v/60hzType: Portable Ice Make rice Shape: Bullet Full Ice Basket Indicator: Yes Add Water Indicator: Yes Automatic Overflow Protection: Yes Operating Cycle: 6 minutes Ice Making Capacity Per Cycle: 9 pieces Daily Ice Making Capacity: 35 pounds Ice Size: Small, Medium and Large Refrigerant: R134a 22oz/63gCertifications: ETL, CSA, UL Listed Overall Dimension: 11-1/2\"(W) x 13-1/2\"(L) x 15\"(H) Includes: Countertop Ice Make rice Scoop User Manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QtSwOVcfL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Della","source_asin":"B01DB1OV2C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DB1OV2C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DB1OV2C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":139220,"name":"Waterspecialist 469690 ADQ36006101 Refrigerator Water Filter and Air Filter, Replacement for LG® LT700P®, Kenmore® 9690, 46-9690, ADQ36006102 and LT12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z49nmIxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Waterspecialist refrigerator water filter features filtration performance is comparable to the original brand. It is also certified by authority NSF 42 and 372. Far different from generic brand, Waterspecialist only adopts 100% superior coconut shell carbon block to improve taste and odor. Great filtration: Waterspecialist refrigerator filters can remove many harmful substances in water including chlorine, taste and odor. This has been tested and proven by an independent third-party laboratory. Premium filter material: Waterspecialist selected BPA-free and food-grade filter housing that passed NSF 372 certification for lead-free filtration. We also adopt 100% natural coconut shell carbon block that contains larger surface area and more micropores than inferior carbon block. Thus, the filter cartridge can efficiently remove chlorine, bad taste and odor. Perfect fit: Waterspecialist combines precision measurement technology to produce 100% fit refrigerator filters with exquisite engineering designs, unlike inferior replacement filters that can cause water leakage issues. Also, Waterspecialist saves you time and hassle by offering tool-free refrigerator filter replacements. Fresh-tasting water: The 100% natural coconut shell carbon block absorbs more impurities than low-priced and mixed carbon block. The Waterspecialist refrigerator filter provides you a unique filtration experience. The air filter keeps your food's tastes and smells separated, making the air inside your refrigerator fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z49nmIxAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waterspecialist","source_asin":"B078W7DLBM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078W7DLBM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B078W7DLBM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
