window.products.push({"id":139290,"name":"Amana 6.5 -Cubic Foot Traditional Gas Dryer, NGD4500VQ, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718SacfSY+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Product Description Amana 6.5 cu. ft. Gas Dryer. Upgrade your laundry room with a Super Capacity gas dryer. Loading and unloading is quick and easy with a wide-opening, side-swing door. Plus, the Wrinkle Prevent option helps keep wrinkles from setting in. Product Features Additional Features 6.5 cu. ft. Capacity This dryer is made totally spacious to fit more in every load. Modern Styling Create a laundry room as chic as your wardrobe. The contemporary lines and unique accent colors on the console give you a look that's tailored to perfection. Wrinkle Prevent Option Put a stop to wrinkles. An extended tumbling time helps prevent dry clothes from developing those pesky creases. Automatic Dryness Control It's under control. Automatically monitors drying temperature so you don't have to worry about overdrying. Wide-Opening Reversible-Swing Door A wide-opening dryer door makes it easier to load and unload clothing. Plus, a reversible door creates greater installation flexibility. Air Fluff Cycle Unheated air gently dries heat-sensitive fabrics. 7 cycles 7 cycles 3 temperature settings 3 temperature settings 60 minute timed dry 60 minute timed dry On/off end-of-cycle signal On/off end-of-cycle signal Optional drying rack Optional drying rack Matching Appliances Amana 3.1 cu. ft. Top Load Washer Parts & Accessories Gas Hook-Up Kit This kit contains everything you need to get your gas dryer going—a stainless gas connector, pipe thread sealant, the proper fitting and a leak test solution. Dryer Vent Installer Kit Keep it flowing with safe and efficient metal venting. A 4' vent section attaches to a close elbow, while another attaches to a wall offset. Plus, an extension collar takes it to greater lengths. Dryer Vent Cleaning Brush Help lower utility bills, reduce drying time and extend the life of your dryer by thoroughly removing lint on a regular basis. Great for dryers with top-mounted lint screens. Before You Buy Does your current dryer cook your clothes? How often do items come out just a little bit smaller? Don't worry, we've got it under control—Automatic Dryness Control. Amana dryers monitor temperatures so you don't have to. Clothes get the attention they need and come out dry—but not smaller. Is it often a challenge to load and unload your current dryer? Stop the struggle with an Amana dryer. The side-swing dryer door features a wide opening. You can even reverse the way the dryer door opens for extra convenience. Would you like a laundry room that has a little style? With contemporary lines and unique accent colors on the console, Amana top load laundry pairs add a little something to any room. Do clothes come out more wrinkled than you expected when using your current dryer? The Wrinkle Prevent option intermittently tumbles clothes without heat once the cycle is over so clothes come out less wrinkled and more ready-to-wear. Dimensions Key Considerations Tip #1 Measure the space for your new washer (or laundry pair) as well as any doorways or hallways the appliances must fit through. Tip #2 Make sure the floor is level, with no more than a 1\" slope. Tip #3 If installing a laundry pair, ensure that there are hot and cold water lines within 3' of washer hookups. Tip #4 Don't forget that your gas dryer will need an approved gas line with shut off valve. Warranty Information Limited One Year Warranty - Parts and Labor - For one (1) year from the original retail purchase date, any part that fails in normal home use will be repaired or replaced free of charge. Refer to amana.com or the individual product Use and Care Guide for warranty details. From the Manufacturer Upgrade your laundry room with a stylish Amana gas dryer. With a 6.5 cu. ft. Super Capacity you can dry more at a time so you'll spend less time doing laundry. A total of 7 cycles and 3 temperature settings provide a variety of drying options for your clothes. The Wrinkle Prevent option tumbles clothes without heat once the cycle is finished to help keep wrinkles from setting in. Also, Automatic Dryness Control monitors the drying temperature so you don't have to worry about overdrying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718SacfSY+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AMANA","source_asin":"B001E1QHN8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E1QHN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E1QHN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
