window.products.push({"id":139428,"name":"Dr.Prepare Countertop Nugget Ice Maker, Pebble Ice Machine, Produces Ice in 8 Mins, 40 lbs Per Day, 3.2L Large Water Tank, Self Cleaning, for Home, Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lhTwGWLaL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Note: Please check the dimensions and weight of this appliance to confirm if it fits your space. Just 8 Minutes - Enjoy your first batch of soft and chewable ice in just 8 minutes! Thanks to its fridge-grade compressor and improved refrigeration system with faster cooling capabilities, our nugget ice maker produces ice faster than most other similar products. Up to 40 pounds of ice per day, satisfying your household or party ice needs. Soft & Chewable Ice - Crunchy and chewable sonic nugget ice, won't hurt your teeth! It's light and airy, allowing it to float at the top of drinks and distribute more evenly than hard cube ice. It stays intact longer than crushed ice, and gets softer over time. Ideal for the smoothest smoothies, nutrient-packed acai bowls, cocktails, and more. Effortless Cleaning Solutions - Press the \"CLEAN\" button to start the cleaning process effortlessly. Ensure you enjoy healthy, fresh, and tasty nugget ice at all times. If you live in an area with hard water, we highly recommend using this function once a month or more frequently. Smart Infrared Sensor - Adopting advanced infrared sensing technology, this ice maker machine will automatically stop when it detects the ice storage bin is full, or when water is low. Instead of wasting excess water from melted ice, this portable ice maker uses it all. It recycles melted pellet ice to make more ice and eliminates the need for a drain. Life-changing Ice Maker - Enjoy restaurant-quality chewable nugget ice at home at all times, saving you time and money. Crafted with food-grade BPA-free materials and corrosion-resistant aluminum alloy housing, it's a long-term investment for ice lovers, definitely! Well-designed package can be a great gift for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lhTwGWLaL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DR.PREPARE","source_asin":"B0BRB32RHP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRB32RHP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRB32RHP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":139429,"name":"Portable Washing Machine Nictemaw 15.6Lbs Capacity Portable Washer 1.9 Cu.ft Full-Automatic Compact Laundry Washer with Drain Pump, 10 Programs/8 Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612tUwNP35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👚【2-In-1 Full Automatic Washer & Spin Dryer Combo】--- Designed with a Full-Automatic System, Equipped with a single cylinder & drain pump, the washing machine not only can be used to wash your clothes but also for drying them. And washing and dehydration can be used separately. You only need to set the washing/spinning program, and then it can work alone. The washing machine is equipped with an extended drain pipe and a drain pump to help your washing machine drain water easily and quickly. 👗【Multi-Function Control Panel】--- There are 10 programs on the control panel, 8 water level selections and timer on the LED display. All functions and operations are clearly listed, including water level/rotation, program/delay, time setting and child lock. It also includes detergent and program options to meet your needs for selecting the appropriate programs and water level according to different cloth. Equipped with a faucet adapter to meet the needs of the faucet interface. 👔【Compact Design & Large Load Capacity】--- Comes with spacious capacity, powerful motor and drain pump, this washer machine is compact and lightweight for you to easily move it in your home. No installation and easy operation.The transparent lid allows you to view and monitor the water and washing conditions.The honeycomb shaped inner tub can load 15.5lbs at one time and wash many clothes for you. Suitable for dorms, apartment, condos, RV's, camping and more. 👕【Automatic Imbalance Adjustment and Adjustable Foot】--- While spinning, if the laundries inside the tub are not put equally, it would cause violent vibration. At this time, Nictemaw portable washing machine’s imbalance adjustment function will start automatically to adjust the imbalance situation if vibration is beyond certain level. Bottom feet can be adjusted to meet your needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612tUwNP35L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nictemaw","source_asin":"B0B9M8RFSB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B9M8RFSB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B9M8RFSB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
