window.products.push({"id":139599,"name":"Karinear Electric Cooktop 110V, 12'' Stainless Steel Built-in and Countertop Electric Stove top 2 Burners with Knob Control, 16 Power Levels,Over-Heat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":146.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lX73C8yKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Knob Control Electric Cooktop】This portable electric stove is very simple to use because it has no complex functions. It only has two knobs, each of which controls a burner. Even the elderly can easily use the 120v electric cooktop. Compared with other sensor touch electric stove, I think the knob type electric stove top is more suitable for the elderly or people with poor eyesight. 【120v Electric Cooktop with Outlet Plug】The 2 burners electric cooktop is suitable for 110~120v, with a plug that is suitable for American families, so you needn't to spend more money to find electricians to help with wiring. More conveniently, you can install the stove by two way. You can install our bottom bracket under the portable electric stove and put it on the desktop for use; If you want to save space, you can open a hole to install the drop-in electric cooktop. 【Electric Cooktop 2 Burners with 16 Power Levels】This 12 inch electric cooktop two burners have 16 power levels, which can control the fire more accurately and meet various cooking methods,perfect for braise, fry, deep fry, stir-fry, roast, and more.Two burners of the 12'' electric cooktop can work at the same time, which can save you half of the cooking time. 【Portable Stainless Steel Electric Cooktop】Compared with other glass electric cooktop, the shell of this electric stove is mainly made of stainless steel, so its quality will be very light. It's easier to move it anywhere. The portable electric stove heating panel is a ceramic panel, which is easy to clean. Just wipe it with a damp cloth.The ceramic stove works by far infrared heating and has no electromagnetic radiation, pregnant women can also use it. 【Compatible with any Flat-bottomed Kitchenware】The advantage of electric ceramic stove is that it is compatible with flat bottomed cookers of any material. As long as it is a pan, it can be heated on electric hot plate. If there is any quality problem with the electric radiant cooktop, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lX73C8yKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Karinear","source_asin":"B0CGWX7YTK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139599","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CGWX7YTK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0CGWX7YTK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
