window.products.push({"id":139833,"name":"COSTWAY 2-in-1 Water Cooler Dispenser with Built-in Ice Maker, Freestanding Hot Cold Top Loading Water Dispenser, 27Lbs/24H Ice Maker Machine with Chi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KImEg1TNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"🧊【Elegant Sleek Design】This water dispense will look classy in your home, office or any public space. It has a sleek design yet it is super powerful and it’s built to last for many years. 🧊【Built-In Ice Maker】Ice basket holds up to 4lbs of ice. It can make 9 bullet ice cubes at a time in 6-14 minutes. It is able to make up to 27lbs per day, you'll never have to deal with pesky ice trays ever again. 🧊【Control Panel & LED Indicators】It is easy to use the control panel to start making ice, hot or cold water. LED indicators let you see at a glance whether the water dispenser is on or off and whether it's heating, cooling or making ice. 🧊【Tri-Temp Water Cooler】This water dispenser features a Tri-temp push button faucet making it easy to dispense cold, hot and room-temperature water. Near boiling hot water is great for instant beverages and meals. 🧊【Child Safety Lock】It is equipped with a child safety lock on the hot water spout, so the entire family can use it worry-free. This user-friendly security lock on the hot water faucet can prevent accidental burns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51KImEg1TNL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COSTWAY","source_asin":"B07FNK4CBS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FNK4CBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FNK4CBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":139834,"name":"36\" island mount Range Hood Stainless Steel Tempered Glass Canopy & High-end LED Lights touch screen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517urO-3wvL._AC_SL1325_.jpg","description":"We are pleased to present the LOH8901, a 36-inch island-mounted stainless steel kitchen range hood with arched tempered glass and other high-end features at an incredible price! This range hood features a two-piece adjustable chimney with sleek curved edges, no visible welded seam on any of the four faces of the chimney, touch screen control panel on both sides of the hood, and three speed settings. It also features four high-end LED lights, Don't settle for a cheaper model with poor lighting -- good visibility is important while using your stove! Also included are a flexible aluminum pipe for easy attachment to the ceiling, two aluminum baffle grease filters (dishwasher friendly), a UL-certified motor, and charcoal carbon filters for optional vent-less installation (no additional kit required). Made from corrosion-resistant 304 stainless steel and built to last! Technical specifications are as follows: Vent exhaust: 6-inch diameter. Dimensions: 36 inches wide x 23.62 inches deep. Height is adjustable to a maximum of 44.5 inches. Standard operation voltage for the US and Canada: 110v/60hz. Maximum suction capacity: 840 cubic meters per hour. Please ensure that this is sufficient suction power for your stove. One year manufacturer's defect warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517urO-3wvL._AC_SL1325_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"InnovationX","source_asin":"B01BPDQI1K","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139834","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BPDQI1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BPDQI1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":139835,"name":"Silonn Countertop Nugget Ice Maker, Pebble Ice Maker Machine, 44lbs of Ice Per Day, Automatic Timer & Self-Cleaning, Pellet Ice Maker for Home Office ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0XTEo8EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you like chewing on the soft, crunchy ice that you get from Sonic, a nugget ice maker would be the perfect addition to your kitchen. If you ask any ice lover, they’ll tell you that not all ice is created equal. In fact, many people swear that nugget ice—also called pebble ice—is the best ice, hands-down, as it comes in small pieces that are perfectly soft and chewable. Nugget Ice, Pebble Ice, and Pellet Ice, they’re the same thing. Looking for a pebble ice maker that can fit next to your toaster? This Silonn nugget ice maker gets excellent reviews for performance and ice quality must be your next choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71q0XTEo8EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silonn","source_asin":"B0BBGFRL9X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-139835","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBGFRL9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBGFRL9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
